{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 女性发型库｜结构参考批次07\n\n## 长款 Hush Cut＋轻狼尾＋碎薄帘刘海\n\n**纠错：本批不代表用户个人发型偏好。** 用户只是指出批次01中的经典公主切模特图质量很高，希望沿其图源渠道继续寻找高质量中国女性发型人像。\n\n本批仅保留为 Hush 结构参考，不纳入用户偏好结论。","x":-1450,"y":-850,"width":2900,"height":430,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"definition","type":"text","text":"# 结构判定\n\n**主类型：** 长款 Hush Cut\n**次类型：** 轻狼尾／长层Shag\n**刘海：** 碎薄帘刘海＋长脸周须\n\n**必须保留**\n- 长度到胸下或更长\n- 冠部轻体量，不做厚圆壳\n- 眼角、颧骨、下颌至少三级脸周层\n- 发尾细长、轻、连续\n\n**排除**\n- 水母头：上下硬断层过强\n- 经典狼尾：前短后长和后颈尾过强\n- 蝴蝶剪：吹风外翻和90年代大体量过强\n- 普通长直发：脸周层和冠部纹理不足\n\n**状态：** `structure-reference / not-user-preference`","x":-800,"y":1450,"width":1600,"height":850,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ref-01","type":"file","file":"05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_01_possible_original.jpg","x":-1450,"y":-250,"width":500,"height":281},
		{"id":"card-01","type":"text","text":"# 01｜顺直长层轻狼尾\n### Sleek Layered Wolf / Hush Hybrid\n\n这是此前误判阶段保存的 Hush 候选，不是批次01经典公主切原图，也不代表用户偏好。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://thebeautyfoodie.com/korean-wolf-cut/)\n\n图源：TheBeautyFoodie，条目 7：Sleek Layered Wolf Cut\n\n**状态：** `structure-reference / source-confirmed`","x":-910,"y":-250,"width":820,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ref-02","type":"file","file":"05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_02_soft_black_korean_layers.png","x":0,"y":-250,"width":333,"height":500},
		{"id":"card-02","type":"text","text":"# 02｜柔黑韩式长层\n### Soft Black Korean-Inspired Layers\n\n保留黑长发主体，以柔和脸周层和轻薄轮廓增加流动，不做强烈鲻鱼尾。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://creativebooster.net/blogs/hairstyles/long-layered-haircuts-2026)\n\n图源：CreativeBooster，条目21\n\n**状态：** `structure-reference / source-confirmed`","x":540,"y":-250,"width":820,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ref-03","type":"file","file":"05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_03_long_hush_cut.jpg","x":-1450,"y":510,"width":500,"height":500},
		{"id":"card-03","type":"text","text":"# 03｜长款羽毛Hush层次\n### Long Feathered Hush Cut\n\n轻羽毛层、脸周渐进层次、薄刘海和长发主体并存，属于 Hush 结构方向的柔和端。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.mujerhoy.com/belleza/pelo/corte-hush-cut-tendencia-pelo-otono-2023-20230923114458-nt.html)\n\n图源：Mujerhoy / @jimmywaworuntu\n\n**状态：** `structure-reference / source-confirmed`","x":-910,"y":510,"width":820,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ref-04","type":"file","file":"05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_04_wispy_fringe_hush.jpg","x":0,"y":510,"width":500,"height":500},
		{"id":"card-04","type":"text","text":"# 04｜韩式碎薄帘刘海Hush\n### Korean Wispy Fringe Hush Cut\n\n重点观察碎薄刘海、颧骨至下颌的脸侧短层，以及发尾轻而不断的长轴。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.mujerhoy.com/belleza/pelo/corte-hush-cut-tendencia-pelo-otono-2023-20230923114458-nt.html)\n\n图源：Mujerhoy / @my.o_noji\n\n**状态：** `structure-reference / source-confirmed`","x":540,"y":510,"width":820,"height":500,"color":"4"}
	],
